    # object that defines a name before reading any source about it - this is the third time in this
    # walk that the name's directory was not its object's.
    #
    # The object is `.text` 0x3AD8, `__DATA, __data` 0xD8, `.rodata.str1.1` 0x29, `.rodata` 0x48;
    # 74 definitions and 112 references.
    #
    # **9 resolved, 37 added.** Resolved, all functions and no storage: the accessors the stepping
