    # `.text` 0x117BE0 -> **0x11BB00**: the object's 0x3AD8 plus its `.rodata` 0x29 + 0x48, minus the
    # nine retired stub bodies (0xD8) and their nine name strings (0xE7), plus the 35 new stub bodies
