    # ## Prediction: the stop
    #
    # **`stub_hit=uuid_generate`, at key `xnu_entry_stub_caller_v=0x8014E540`** - the `bl` at
    # `IOPMrootDomain::start + 0x5F0`. In source it is `IOPMrootDomain::start` line 1200's
