    #
    # **Next: `iokit/Kernel/IOStartIOKit.cpp`** (`iokit_Kernel_IOStartIOKit.o`, manifest:346) - the ordinary
    # shape, and the largest closure in many steps. `.text` **876**, `.bss` **12**, `.rodata.str1.1` **142**,
